  "summary": "Cuby makes a small controller that drives mini-split air conditioners over infrared and exposes them on Modbus RTU. The registers set power, mode, fan speed, setpoint, vanes and turbo, and report indoor temperature, humidity, occupancy and contact-open time from Cuby sensors. All values are single 16-bit registers.",
