  "notes": [
    "Hosted on Cuby's own HubSpot file storage (pages.cuby.mx).",
    "The unit address is fixed at 1 and the serial setting is 9600 8N1 in this firmware; the sheet says later firmware will make them configurable.",
    "Indoor temperature, humidity, occupancy and open time read -32768 until a value is available; signed 16-bit is assumed for those rows because of that initial value.",
    "Address 5 and other gaps are not listed in the source."
